    kind: work_item  # 0f2b
    title: "rust: a call to a use-imported function binds by discovery order (a test helper under a survey's sorted order), and receiver and path calls bind to the enclosing function"  # 0f2b
    status: todo_hard  # 0f2b
    priority: 2  # 0f2b
    parent:  # 0f2b
    tags:  # 0f2b
