  message: "Fixed in PR #1973 (9591306872). Re-run on merged dev, live: hypergumbo survey of the aardvark-dns crate copy (sorted FileIndex order, the order that showed the defect): src/server/serve.rs:287 parse_configs -> src/config/mod.rs (was src/test/test.rs, the cfg(test) helper); src/test/test.rs:37 config::parse_configs -> src/config/mod.rs (was itself, then dropped as a self-loop); src/error.rs:105/:109 self.0.push / self.0.is_empty emit no first-party edge (were self-bindings). With rust-analyzer 1.94.0 the live backend-agreement reads calls/in-repo 94/16/6, identical to the recorded harness (was 92/17/8 vs 93/16/7). Corpus A/B (firecracker, ripgrep, just, zellij, diamond-types): 943 call sites changed, two random samples of 10 per class read, all correct but one judgement call (zellij setup_ipc imported under two cfg alternatives now binds the last use). Four mutations each red a test."  # 01f4
